OL,3,GNEWSAUK plans emergency powers to
OL,4,Aprotect undersea cables
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has outlined new
OL,7,Fmeasures to protect the UK's undersea
OL,8,Finternet cables amid increased fears of
OL,9,FRussian interference.
OL,11,FMinisters are set to gain powers to
OL,12,Forder telecom companies to remove or
OL,13,Fdisable services during national
OL,14,Fsecurity emergencies, as well as
OL,15,Fgranting officials access to sites
OL,16,Fincluding cable landing stations.
OL,18,FThe government has also outlined plans
OL,19,Ffor stronger criminal penalties for
OL,20,Fthose convicted of tampering with
OL,21,Feither undersea internet cables or
OL,22,Fenergy pipelines.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
