OL,3,GNEWSAUK plans emergency powers to
OL,4,Aprotect undersea cables
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new powers would be backed up with
OL,7,Fprison sentences of up to 14 years for
OL,8,Fintentional conduct, 10 years for
OL,9,Freckless conduct and two years for
OL,10,Fgrossly negligent conduct, alongside
OL,11,Funlimited fines.
